  "title": "Jamaican Spiked Chicken and Rice",
  "description": "Rum-spiked chicken in tasty sauce atop a bed of rice. Topped with banana slices. This is my favorite dish to prepare because you get to set the chicken on fire.",
  "authors": [
    "IIJUAN12"
